{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6109f43cc868282d52430af91818132c4912728527f64216d813afd6e0178392", "ja": "（高校のダンス部とコラボした『My Evolution』\nの生放送お披露目はかなりの反響だった）", "zh": "（和高中舞蹈部合作的《My Evolution》在直播中的首次亮相，反响相当热烈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "34014a737afd84ef3c05fc03c0c07e3743de9367c981548f4595effbec78f86a", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}！\nSNSのトレンド見たっ！？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！\n你看SNS上的热搜了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1c04edf295f7b4ea2ead6d4f9aeaa869bc84f16526c694002ccd833bc7990d08", "ja": "『#マイエボチャレンジ』だよな？\nかなり盛り上がってくれてるみたいじゃないか！", "zh": "是“#MyEvoChallenge”对吧？\n看起来反响相当热烈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "1f642e99059fe1a730a72099a50d523cd764b3f18a4acd5e9bd0f40daeb8b75c", "ja": "だよねだよね！　私達のダンスを踊った動画とかも\nいっぱい上げてくれてるの！　すごいよねっ！", "zh": "对吧对吧！大家还上传了好多跳我们舞蹈的视频呢，真的很厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "79ad70a511961dc8ba8c500f8685117896bf6aa83bc21e30246c0a017c72e514", "ja": "同年代の子だけじゃなくて、まだちっちゃい子とか、\nかわいいお婆さんって人も踊ってくれてて……。", "zh": "不仅有同龄的孩子，还有年纪很小的小朋友，\n甚至还有可爱的老奶奶也在跳呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "1bb40001add2209e30af6a4d0e6352d65d76e9995af881882964186152110d28", "ja": "それを見たら……なんかもう、すごいすごい！って、\nいつも以上にじっとしていられなくなっちゃった☆", "zh": "看到那个之后……不知怎么的，就觉得太厉害了太厉害了！比平时更坐不住了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c6f6db19cc78a3cb5130fbabaa7fd91d34f8d64f1dfdf6f1b1007c40b02ada21", "ja": "はは、ダンス経験者だけじゃなくて、ダンス初心者の\n人も踊ってくれてるみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，不只是有舞蹈经验的人，连舞蹈初学者也都在跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "490f5ac696e9154a4f7c386bedbf8e78bb8c533eba5a6af0e591e90e02e88c11", "ja": "うん！　みんなが踊ってくれてるから、\n自分も踊りたくなったって人もいっぱい！", "zh": "嗯！因为大家都在跳舞，所以也有很多人因此想跟着一起跳呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "4d77397f8ed62af9815f587d07868ba80ae1a6b86ce206687189f366cc842726", "ja": "これってさ、前に歩が言ってた\n「ユニットの目標」に近づけたってことだよね！", "zh": "这就是说，我们已经接近步之前提到的“组合目标”了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1009_p", "source_sha256": "830b87e2616cadf7068d3b459137328924e312a88ce0feb0f670fd783041ccc6", "ja": "「ファンのみんなも、ユニットと一緒に楽しんで\nほしい」ってやつだな。うん、近づけていると思う。", "zh": "「希望粉丝们也能和组合一起乐在\n其中」的那件事吧。嗯，我觉得确实更近了一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "3721aeeb8530fbae9f07ef11b3de2a966c70dee525126501083849207958b14f", "ja": "やったー！！　じゃあ目標にもっと近づくために\n思いついたことがあるんだけど～！", "zh": "太棒啦——！！那为了离目标更近一步，\n我想到一个好点子～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e09552179a622c4efb968fa9e80e3fb218b90c570d58fd8d6f7d3a9ad0011df", "ja": "ダンス部のみんなと私たちで、\nダンスの説明動画を作ってアップするのはどうかな？", "zh": "要不要由舞蹈部的大家和我们一起制作舞蹈教学视频并上传呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "d9aec54332389bdabe9d25af1c14cac240c5094a20cf74028442b34923f64918", "ja": "一つ一つの動きを見せながら説明できたら、もっと\n沢山の人が踊ってくれる！と、思ったんだけど……", "zh": "要是能一边展示每一个动作一边讲解，就会有更多人来跳！我是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "d115f93e24fc1d245d57919773bb79d192d3cb98e7d39306b96bd11ade528b97", "ja": "{$P$}、やってみていい？", "zh": "{$P$}，我可以试试看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1014_p", "source_sha256": "36b81c5683138563117b00eb052e1b26f2cbf744f7b60c81ad683be773c91f3a", "ja": "もちろん！　海美たちが掴んだチャンス、\n全力でサポートさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "当然可以！你们好不容易抓住的机会，\n我会全力支援海美的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0623_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "d7885be272560dba4f239f2e3124a19012d169557a39b48c03dd309e85caa426", "ja": "ありがとー！！　じゃあ早速、みんなに伝えてくるね♪\nよ～し……目指せ、ドームでディスコライブ☆", "zh": "太感谢啦——！！那我现在就去告诉大家哦♪\n好～嘞……目标是在巨蛋办迪斯科演出☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
